PartialFillSettler_onPremiumLegFill
├── when phase-1 forward reverts with non-empty err bytes
│   └── it should emit PremiumHooksReverted with the bubbled err bytes and orderDigest and targetFiller
├── when phase-1 forward reverts after settler-state writes
│   └── it should leave f.premiumSettled committed as true
├── when phase-1 forward reverts and the caller later invokes finaliseAsSettled
│   └── it should route dstCST to the filler's destination normally
├── when forward succeeds
│   └── it should write premiumSettled AFTER forward returns (order-of-writes assertion)
├── when forward catches
│   └── it should write premiumSettled AFTER forward returns (order-of-writes assertion)
├── when cellar premiumFiredFor is false after successful forward
│   └── it should revert StateDivergence
├── when cellar premiumFiredFor is true after successful forward
│   └── it should accept and latch premiumSettled
└── when settler writes PREMIUM_FILLER_SLOT before forward
    └── it should expose targetFiller via tload during phase-1 forward
